its 20f2d485 or 28c6940. The CI record preserves the provider's 500 KB workflow-size annotation; the archived Root observation does not preserve a raw Actions API run/jobs response. The check-runs JSON and provider HTML are retained separately.\n+\n+The paired-source record identifies shared suite b67efe786fb0c0f64db2aca62c572b700f2a5247d7a2258deab1313bdb581a5d and common package tree c962085b9c9e6b80ddba31d8c82e01c8d2e97179. It records paired execution NOT_RUN and corpus NOT_ADMITTED. These source identities do not change the fixed product comparison pair 1d797d41c8141fcbdc3f69d7f11eb8875ab54712 / b274dd57f4dd078ade6e424d546d83efbd2e8526."},{"sha":"2a0ce3f24735b02069d558f3275105fad74dcb12","filename":"docs/implementation/visibility/evidence/reports/status-source-archive-20261009/raw/termrock-vis01-current-publication-20261009/candidate-q59-publication.json","status":"added","additions":19,"deletions":0,"changes":19,"blob_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/terminal-components-claude/blob/4b473a98a8641a9dae8dbf9c31c0c94b15465496/docs%2Fimplementation%2Fvisibility%2Fevidence%2Freports%2Fstatus-source-archive-20261009%2Fraw%2Ftermrock-vis01-current-publication-20261009%2Fcandidate-q59-publication.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/terminal-components-claude/raw/4b473a98a8641a9dae8dbf9c31c0c94b15465496/docs%2Fimplementation%2Fvisibility%2Fevidence%2Freports%2Fstatus-source-archive-20261009%2Fraw%2Ftermrock-vis01-current-publication-20261009%2Fcandidate-q59-publication.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/terminal-components-claude/contents/docs%2Fimplementation%2Fvisibility%2Fevidence%2Freports%2Fstatus-source-archive-20261009%2Fraw%2Ftermrock-vis01-current-publication-20261009%2Fcandidate-q59-publication.json?ref=4b473a98a8641a9dae8dbf9c31c0c94b15465496","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@\n+{\n+  \"schema\": \"termrock-root-publication/v1\",\n+  \"commit\": \"82ad0dff9eba8ae7748e9bc44623e20fd10d31bc\",\n+  \"parent\": \"570662db5b9d9b86b408bc3